			{itemID=251106,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=260312,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=30544,title="Overview",body="Seranel assaults players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zones]|h|r that cause |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225135|h[Feedback]|h|r to players affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224801|h[Runic Mark]|h|r.\n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Seranel causes an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225193|h[Wave of Silence]|h|r silencing and pacifying players outside of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zones]|h|r."},
			{id=30545,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225193|h[Wave of Silence]|h|r inflicts heavy damage and silences players outside of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zones]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224801|h[Runic Mark]|h|r inflicts moderate damage to nearby players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zone]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225135|h[Feedback]|h|r silences and pacifies players."},
			{id=30546,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225193|h[Wave of Silence]|h|r inflicts heavy damage and silences players outside of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zones]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224801|h[Runic Mark]|h|r inflicts moderate damage to nearby players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zone]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225135|h[Feedback]|h|r silences and pacifies players."},
			{id=30547,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248689|h[Hastening Ward]|h|r increases Seranel's attack speed and causes his melee attacks to inflict additional Arcane damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1225193|h[Wave of Silence]|h|r inflicts heavy damage and silences players outside of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224903|h[Suppression Zones]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1224801|h[Runic Mark]|h|r inflicts moderate damage to nearby players."},
