		},
		sections={
			{id=31279,title="Overview",body="Kystia Manaheart is accompanied by her pet mana wyrm Nibbles, who is controlled by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230289|h[Illicit Infusion]|h|r. When this infusion is removed, Nibbles breaks free of Kystia's control and reverts back to her light form to assist players in battle with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230304|h[Light Infusion]|h|r."},
			{id=31280,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Kystia turns Nibbles hostile to players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230289|h[Illicit Infusion]|h|r.\n$bullet; Avoid Nibbles' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253811|h[Fel Spray]|h|r.\n$bullet; Interrupt Kystia's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264095|h[Mirror Images]|h|r."},
			{id=31281,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Kystia turns Nibbles hostile to players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230289|h[Illicit Infusion]|h|r.\n$bullet; Avoid Nibbles' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253811|h[Fel Spray]|h|r.\n$bullet; Kystia inflicts heavy damage to all players while |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265412|h[Destabilized]|h|r."},
			{id=31282,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Kystia turns Nibbles hostile to players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1230289|h[Illicit Infusion]|h|r.\n$bullet; Avoid Nibbles' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253811|h[Fel Spray]|h|r.\n$bullet; Interrupt Kystia's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1264095|h[Mirror Images]|h|r."},
