			{id=31286,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; At 100 energy, Zaen casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1218347|h[Murder in a Row]|h|r. Get to cover!\n$bullet; Avoid damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:474765|h[Same-Day Delivery]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214357|h[Fire Bomb]|h|r."},
