		name="Xathuux the Annihilator",
		lore="Xathuux the Annihilator is one of Lithiel Cinderfury's most powerful summons. Although he loathes serving the warlock, he follows her commands for the sheer visceral joy of destruction.",
		dungeonEncounterID=3103,
		uiMapID=2434,
