			{itemID=256746,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=263238,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=258045,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=31303,title="Overview",body="|cFF2959D3|Hspell:474462|h[Fingers of Gul'dan]|h|r will summon Wild Imps near every target.\n\nAfter casting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:474462|h[Fingers of Gul'dan]|h|r Lithiel Cinderfury casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214675|h[Demonic Gateway]|h|r to escape and then begins casting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r.\n\n|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r slowly expands over a large area inflicting heavy damage along with lingering damage over time.\n\nPlayers traveling through Lithiel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214675|h[Demonic Gateway]|h|r are immune to the initial impact and lingering Fire vulnerability from passing through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r."},
			{id=31304,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r grants |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1226469|h[Malefic Empowerment]|h|r to any summoned demons still alive when it passes over them.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:474375|h[Chaos Bolt]|h|r inflicts high damage to a random target if not interrupted."},
			{id=31305,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:474375|h[Chaos Bolt]|h|r inflicts high damage to a random target if not interrupted.\n\n$bullet;Furious Vilefiend inflicts heavy damage."},
			{id=31306,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r  applies lingering damage over time when players using Lithiel's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214675|h[Demonic Gateway]|h|r pass through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1217345|h[Malefic Wave]|h|r.\n\n$bullet;Furious Vilefiend inflicts heavy damage."},
