		sections={
			{id=31795,title="Overview",body="Rotmire catalyzes the growth of new fungal minions with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221622|h[Awaken Fungi]|h|r. \n\nUpon reaching 100 energy, Rotmire creates a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221637|h[Fungal Bloom]|h|r that grows |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221965|h[Bursting Shrooms]|h|r from minions' corpses."},
			{id=31796,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Rotmire inflicts heavy damage to his current target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221781|h[Putrid Fist]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221637|h[Fungal Bloom]|h|r grows deadly |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221965|h[Bursting Shrooms]|h|r from minions' corpses."},
			{id=31797,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221622|h[Awaken Fungi]|h|r grows fungal minions from the earth.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221637|h[Fungal Bloom]|h|r grows deadly |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221965|h[Bursting Shrooms]|h|r from minions' corpses."},
			{id=31798,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Rotmire inflicts massive damage to all players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221637|h[Fungal Bloom]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1222088|h[Festering Vines]|h|r inflict heavy damage to several players.\n$bullet; The |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1222176|h[Rotting Pustules]|h|r leftover from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1221787|h[Bursting Pustules]|h|r inflict steadily increasing damage over time."},
