			{itemID=249319,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=264497,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=32167,title="Overview",body="Averzian uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251361|h[Shadow's Advance]|h|r to claim territory on the battlefield. Territory claimed cannot be retaken, and if Averzian claims three adjacent territories in a row he unleashes the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251583|h[March of the Endless]|h|r.\n\nCausing an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249262|h[Umbral Collapse]|h|r on a territory being taken prevents its capture."},
			{id=32168,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Abyssal Voidshapers attempt to use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255749|h[Gathering Darkness]|h|r at full power.\n$bullet; Shadowguard Stalwarts attempt to empower their allies with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255702|h[Pitch Bulwark]|h|r."},
			{id=32169,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249251|h[Dark Upheaval]|h|r inflicts periodic damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249262|h[Umbral Collapse]|h|r inflicts damage to everyone that is reduced by the number of players at the impact location."},
			{id=32170,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Averzian gains |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253918|h[Imperator's Glory]|h|r while close to territory he controls.\n$bullet; When Averzian strikes his current target he infects them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265540|h[Blackening Wounds]|h|r."},
			{id=34566,title="Stage One",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=34567,title="Abyssal Voidshaper",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
			{id=34569,title="Section 22"},
