			{id=33962,title="Abyssal Voidshaper",body="$[!16On Mythic difficulty, Abyssal Voidshapers cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255749|h[Gathering Darkness]|h|r to transform into Obscurion Endwalkers. In addition, they also cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1280035|h[Cosmic Shell]|h|r to become immune to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249262|h[Umbral Collapse]|h|r."},
