		sections={
			{id=32175,title="Overview",body="The dragon siblings begin battle alternating between flying and grounded combat, swapping after |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249748|h[Midnight Flames]|h|r at full power. In response, the Lightbound Vanguard offer aid by providing their |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248847|h[Radiant Barrier]|h|r to nearby players.\n\nEventually, both dragons land, combining their draconic might to annihilate players once and for all."},
			{id=32176,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245391|h[Gloom]|h|r applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245554|h[Gloomtouched]|h|r upon contact and shrinks the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245420|h[Gloomfield]|h|r formed.\n$[15,16$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262623|h[Nullbeam]|h|r creates a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244672|h[Nullzone]|h|r tethering players, causing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244413|h[Nullsnap]|h|r or |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252157|h[Nullzone Implosion]|h|r when stretching the tether.$]\n$[14,17$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262623|h[Nullbeam]|h|r creates a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244672|h[Nullzone]|h|r tethering players, causing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244413|h[Nullsnap]|h|r when stretching the tether.$]\n$[14,15,16$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244221|h[Dread Breath]|h|r targets a player but affects all players in front of Vaelgor.$]\n$[17$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244917|h[Void Howl]|h|r summons Voidorbs which continually cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245175|h[Voidbolt]|h|r.$]\n$[14,15,16$bullet;Manifestation of Midnight's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1270497|h[Shadowmark]|h|r detonates upon expiration.$]"},
			{id=32177,title="Healers",body="$[14,17$bullet;Stretching |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244672|h[Nullzone]|h|r's tether triggers |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244413|h[Nullsnap]|h|r, inflicting damage to all players.$]\n$[15,16$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244672|h[Nullzone]|h|r's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244413|h[Nullsnap]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252157|h[Nullzone Implosion]|h|r inflict damage to all players, but |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252157|h[Nullzone Implosion]|h|r also applies a short duration high intensity damage over time effect.$]\n$bullet;The Lightbound Vanguard grant |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248847|h[Radiant Barrier]|h|r to players nearby, reducing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249748|h[Midnight Flames]|h|r' high damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245554|h[Gloomtouched]|h|r players decrease the total damage inflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245391|h[Gloom]|h|r and shrink the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245420|h[Gloomfield]|h|r formed."},
			{id=32178,title="Tanks",body="$[14,15,17$bullet;Both |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262623|h[Nullbeam]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245391|h[Gloom]|h|r orient in the direction of the dragon's primary target, as well as |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244221|h[Dread Breath]|h|r while flying.$]\n$[16$bullet;Both |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262623|h[Nullbeam]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245391|h[Gloom]|h|r orient in the direction of the dragon's current target.$]\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245645|h[Rakfang]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265131|h[Vaelwing]|h|r empower the dragon when cast at the same target.\n$bullet;Receiving |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1262623|h[Nullbeam]|h|r stacks decrease the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244672|h[Nullzone]|h|r's pull magnitude for all players.\n$[14,15,17$bullet;While flying, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1280458|h[Grappling Maw]|h|r pulls the dragon's primary target and inflicts increasing damage as their distance increases.$]"},
			{id=34394,title="Vaelgor & Ezzorak"},
