		sections={
			{id=32179,title="Overview",body="Fallen-King Salhadaar is infused with power from the surrounding machinery, slowly increasing his energy over time. Upon reaching 100 energy, he is overwhelmed by the Void and begins his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246175|h[Entropic Unraveling]|h|r. \n\nPeriodically, the Riftlabs produce orbs of Concentrated Void that are drawn toward Salhadaar. When an orb of Concentrated Void reaches him, he performs a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245960|h[Void Infusion]|h|r."},
			{id=32180,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Orbs of Concentrated Void cause a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245960|h[Void Infusion]|h|r when they reach Salhadaar.\n$bullet; Salhadaar takes increased damage during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246175|h[Entropic Unraveling]|h|r.\n$bullet; Salhadaar creates several Fractured Images that cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1254088|h[Shadow Fracture]|h|r."},
			{id=32181,title="Healers",body="$bullet; When orbs of Concentrated Void are destroyed, they apply |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1250991|h[Dark Radiation]|h|r to all players.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248697|h[Despotic Command]|h|r inflicts periodic damage to nearby players and applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248709|h[Oppressive Darkness]|h|r when removed.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246175|h[Entropic Unraveling]|h|r inflicts heavy periodic damage to all players."},
			{id=32182,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Orbs of Concentrated Void cause a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1245960|h[Void Infusion]|h|r when they reach Salhadaar.\n$bullet; Spikes erupt from the target of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253032|h[Shattering Twilight]|h|r.\n$bullet; Salhadaar's melee attacks apply |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1271577|h[Destabilizing Strikes]|h|r."},
			{id=35214,title="Section 41",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
