		sections={
			{id=32183,title="Overview",body="The Lightblinded Vanguard attacks players relentlessly as their energy slowly increases.\n\nWhen a member of the Vanguard reaches 100 energy, they activate an Aura to empower their allies and unleash their most devastating attack."},
			{id=32184,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; War Chaplain Senn protects allies within her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248451|h[Aura of Peace]|h|r, pacifying any players who attack them.\n$bullet; Damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248983|h[Execution Sentence]|h|r is split evenly between all players hit.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248674|h[Sacred Shield]|h|r grants immunity to interrupt effects while the shield holds."},
			{id=32185,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248721|h[Tyr's Wrath]|h|r absorbs a large amount of healing done to affected players.\n$bullet; Damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248983|h[Execution Sentence]|h|r is split evenly between all players hit.\n$bullet; General Bellamy silences players struck by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248652|h[Divine Toll]|h|r."},
			{id=32186,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246736|h[Judgment]|h|r significantly increases damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251812|h[Final Verdict]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251859|h[Shield of the Righteous]|h|r.\n$bullet; Damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1248983|h[Execution Sentence]|h|r is split evenly between all players hit.\n$bullet; Members of the Vanguard with an active Aura greatly empower their nearby allies."},
