			{itemID=260408,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=264492,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=265949,diffs={15,16},faction=-1,season=34},
			{itemID=266885,diffs={16},faction=-1,season=34},
			{itemID=267646,diffs={},faction=-1,season=34},
		},
		sections={
			{id=32163,title="Overview",body="The Dark Naaru counts down the minutes with each harrowing toll of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244412|h[Death's Dirge]|h|r that echoes off the sacred walls. |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253915|h[Heaven's Glaives]|h|r rip and tear through the armies of light as L'ura conducts the infinite power held within |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282027|h[The Darkwell]|h|r to extinguish all that is holy.\n\nWhen |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266622|h[Midnight]|h|r falls and Azeroth descends into darkness, brave |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266627|h[Torchbearers]|h|r emerge from the shadows to face |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1250898|h[The Dark Archangel]|h|r and fight to see another sunrise."},
			{id=32164,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Midnight Crystals undergo |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251807|h[Cosmic Fracture]|h|r if not destroyed in time.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244412|h[Death's Dirge]|h|r displays |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249609|h[Dark Runes]|h|r that correspond to the melody's notes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266627|h[Torchbearers]|h|r emit light to protect nearby allies from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266622|h[Midnight]|h|r."},
			{id=32165,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252974|h[Dimming]|h|r Dusk Crystals transform into Dawn Crystals upon reaching full health.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244412|h[Death's Dirge]|h|r displays |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249609|h[Dark Runes]|h|r that correspond to the melody's notes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266627|h[Torchbearers]|h|r emit light to protect nearby allies from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266622|h[Midnight]|h|r."},
			{id=32166,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1263970|h[Heaven's Lance]|h|r inflicts massive damage as the target is |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265842|h[Impaled]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1244412|h[Death's Dirge]|h|r displays |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1249609|h[Dark Runes]|h|r that correspond to the melody's notes.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266627|h[Torchbearers]|h|r emit light to protect nearby allies from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266622|h[Midnight]|h|r."},
			{id=32197,title="Stage One: Final Tolls",body="The clock ticks. The sun sets. The candle burns."},
