			{itemID=251192,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=251165,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=32316,title="Overview",body="Lightwaden Ruia unleashes his druidic power, shapeshifting between Moonkin and Bear forms. At 40% remaining health, he returns to Haranir form and channels |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241067|h[Spirits of the Vale]|h|r, casting all his abilities in a rapid flurry."},
			{id=33028,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1240210|h[Pulverizing Strikes]|h|r launches a cone of Physical damage at each target.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1240098|h[Lightfall]|h|r inflicts high damage to players within each impact."},
			{id=33029,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1241058|h[Grievous Thrash]|h|r is only removed when the afflicted target reaches full health.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1240210|h[Pulverizing Strikes]|h|r launches a cone of Physical damage at each target."},
			{id=33030,title="Tank",body="$bullet; In Moonkin form, Ruia's melee attacks are replaced with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1239821|h[Warden's Wrath]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1240210|h[Pulverizing Strikes]|h|r launches a cone of Physical damage at each target.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1240098|h[Lightfall]|h|r inflicts high damage to players within each impact."},
			{id=33012,title="Moonkin Form"},
