			{itemID=253451,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=268728,diffs={8,23},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=32317,title="Overview",body="Ziekket will periodically |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246372|h[Awaken the Lightbloom]|h|r, sprouting Lightspawn Lashers from the earth and awakening any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246379|h[Dormant]|h|r ones.\n\nSurging with the Light's power, Ziekket projects a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246607|h[Concentrated Lightbeam]|h|r at players that annihilates flora and fauna alike."},
			{id=33193,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246607|h[Concentrated Lightbeam]|h|r vaporizes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246379|h[Dormant]|h|r Lightspawn Lashers into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246660|h[Lightsap]|h|r.\n$bullet; Touching globules of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246858|h[Lightbloom's Essence]|h|r inflicts Holy damage while increasing damage and healing done."},
			{id=33194,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246858|h[Lightbloom's Essence]|h|r inflicts Holy damage to players, but increases damage and healing done.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1247377|h[Oozing Xylem]|h|r continually inflicts Holy damage to all players."},
			{id=33195,title="Tank",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1247685|h[Thornspike]|h|r impales Ziekket's current target.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1246372|h[Awaken the Lightbloom]|h|r summons a thicket of vicious Lightspawn Lashers."},
