			{itemID=251168,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=251163,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=33372,title="Overview",body="Rak'tul batters players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251023|h[Spiritbreaker]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252676|h[Crush Souls]|h|r, forming totems that |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252777|h[Soulbind]|h|r his foes.\n\nAs the fight progresses, Rak'tul unleashes a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253788|h[Soulrending Roar]|h|r, casting players' souls into the Restless Masses and afflicting them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253844|h[Withering Soul]|h|r until they return to the realm of the living."},
			{id=33373,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Totems spawn at each |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252676|h[Crush Souls]|h|r target's location and cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252777|h[Soulbind]|h|r at a player.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253788|h[Soulrending Roar]|h|r applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253844|h[Withering Soul]|h|r until players return to the realm of the living.\n$bullet;Interrupting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1254010|h[Eternal Suffering]|h|r grants |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255629|h[Spectral Residue]|h|r."},
			{id=33374,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Totems spawn at each |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252676|h[Crush Souls]|h|r target's location and cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252777|h[Soulbind]|h|r at a player.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253788|h[Soulrending Roar]|h|r applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253844|h[Withering Soul]|h|r until players return to the realm of the living.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252864|h[Deathgorged Vessel]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players."},
			{id=33375,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Totems spawn at each |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252676|h[Crush Souls]|h|r target's location and cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1252777|h[Soulbind]|h|r at a player.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253788|h[Soulrending Roar]|h|r applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253844|h[Withering Soul]|h|r until players return to the realm of the living.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1251023|h[Spiritbreaker]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to Rak'tul's primary target, launching them into the air."},
