		sections={
			{id=33403,title="Overview",body="Fractured Images of Lothraxion linger with every |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253848|h[Brilliant Dispersion]|h|r, haunting the battlefield. These images |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255531|h[Flicker]|h|r and slice at nearby enemies with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266713|h[Mirrored Rend]|h|r. When he reaches full power, Lothraxion flickers into hiding amongst his images and attempts to overload the core with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1257613|h[Divine Guile]|h|r."},
			{id=33404,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253848|h[Brilliant Dispersion]|h|r inflicts damage to all nearby players.\n$bullet; Fractured Images unleash |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266713|h[Mirrored Rend]|h|r when standing too close.\n$bullet; Lothraxion hides among his distorted images during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1257613|h[Divine Guile]|h|r until he is interrupted."},
			{id=33405,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253848|h[Brilliant Dispersion]|h|r targets several players and inflicts damage to all nearby players when reaching its targeted destination.\n$bullet; Fractured Images unleash |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266713|h[Mirrored Rend]|h|r when standing too close.\n$bullet; Lothraxian hides among his distorted images during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1257613|h[Divine Guile]|h|r until he is interrupted."},
			{id=33406,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1253950|h[Searing Rend]|h|r inflicts heavy Physical damage and leaves behind |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1255389|h[Radiant Scars]|h|r.\n$bullet; Fractured Images unleash |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266713|h[Mirrored Rend]|h|r when standing too close.\n$bullet; Lothraxian hides among his distorted images during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1257613|h[Divine Guile]|h|r until he is interrupted."},
			{id=34712,title="Section 10",body="$[!23\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, interrupting an incorrect Fractured Image causes Core Exposure.$]"},
			{id=34713,title="Section 12",difficultyIDs={23}},
