		sections={
			{id=34740,title="Overview",body="Sszorak relentlessly assaults players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1277025|h[Apex Predator]|h|r combination attacks and noxious |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1305959|h[Venomous Surge]|h|r globs. The Altar of the Six Winds unleashes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285419|h[Raging Crosswinds]|h|r and eventually builds to a massive |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285732|h[Howling Maelstrom]|h|r that pushes players around the arena."},
			{id=34741,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1305959|h[Venomous Surge]|h|r inflicts raid-wide damage. Players farther from the affected player receive less damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285419|h[Raging Crosswinds]|h|r inflicts damage over time before knocking affected players in the indicated direction.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286033|h[Dig In]|h|r increases Sszorak's damage taken during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285732|h[Howling Maelstrom]|h|r."},
			{id=34742,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1305959|h[Venomous Surge]|h|r inflicts raid-wide damage. Players farther from the affected player receive less damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285419|h[Raging Crosswinds]|h|r inflicts damage over time before knocking affected players in the indicated direction.\n$bullet;When the winds in the Altar of Six Winds build to a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285732|h[Howling Maelstrom]|h|r, players are pushed in the wind's direction."},
			{id=34743,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;During |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1277025|h[Apex Predator]|h|r, Sszorak casts a combination of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1277002|h[Ravage]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1277027|h[Mutilate]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282869|h[Corroding Venom]|h|r increases Physical damage taken. This effect stacks.\n$bullet;When the winds in the Altar of Six Winds build to a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285732|h[Howling Maelstrom]|h|r, players are pushed in the wind's direction."},
