			{itemID=273779,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=35024,title="Overview",body="The Writhing Coil assaults its enemies relentlessly with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299940|h[Vindictive Onslaught]|h|r and its razor sharp |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1298949|h[Tail Scythe]|h|r.\n\nWhen the beast prepares to unleash |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299053|h[Death Rattle]|h|r, Orweyna empowers players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287798|h[Vine Grip]|h|r to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287811|h[Uncoil]|h|r the creature and clash with the serpents one by one."},
			{id=35025,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1298949|h[Tail Scythe]|h|r inflicts heavy Physical damage.\n$bullet; Interrupting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299053|h[Death Rattle]|h|r with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287798|h[Vine Grip]|h|r causes the creature to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287811|h[Uncoil]|h|r."},
			{id=35026,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Interrupting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299053|h[Death Rattle]|h|r with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287798|h[Vine Grip]|h|r causes the creature to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287811|h[Uncoil]|h|r.\n$bullet; Damage inflicted while the Writhing Coil is |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300612|h[Uncoiled]|h|r persists after |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300686|h[Assimilation]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1310974|h[Toxic Atrophy]|h|r reduces all players' speed and damage done."},
			{id=35027,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299053|h[Death Rattle]|h|r inflicts increasing damage to all players.\n$bullet; Interrupting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299053|h[Death Rattle]|h|r with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287798|h[Vine Grip]|h|r causes the creature to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287811|h[Uncoil]|h|r."},
