			{itemID=279211,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=270900,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=35029,title="Overview",body="During |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300876|h[Ritual of the Fang]|h|r, Zul'jan invokes the altar's ancient venoms to empower the dagger.\n\nZul'jan then hacks, slashes, and chops down his enemies as the sacred grounds stain crimson with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301217|h[Bloodletting]|h|r."},
			{id=35030,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301350|h[Chop Down]|h|r inflicts heavy Physical damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300876|h[Ritual of the Fang]|h|r inflicts damage to all players unless intercepted.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301217|h[Bloodletting]|h|r removes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300894|h[Ritual Venom]|h|r."},
			{id=35031,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300876|h[Ritual of the Fang]|h|r inflicts damage to all players unless intercepted.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301217|h[Bloodletting]|h|r removes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300894|h[Ritual Venom]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301111|h[Axegrinder]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301413|h[Boneslicer]|h|r inflict Physical damage to players struck."},
			{id=35032,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301111|h[Axegrinder]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301413|h[Boneslicer]|h|r inflict Physical damage to players struck.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300876|h[Ritual of the Fang]|h|r inflicts damage to all players unless intercepted.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301217|h[Bloodletting]|h|r removes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300894|h[Ritual Venom]|h|r."},
