		sections={
			{id=35046,title="Overview",body="Upon reaching 100 energy, Vashnik |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1283164|h[Imbibes]|h|r from the nearest two fountains, increasing his affinity to them. These fountains erupt with vapor, bringing forth living venom that crawl toward the Malignant Cavity in the center of the chamber.\n\nShould a living venom reach its destination, a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1280189|h[Malignant Burst]|h|r occurs."},
			{id=35047,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284670|h[Imbibe]|h|r creates living venom from two nearby fountains.\n\n$bullet; Living venoms explode in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1280189|h[Malignant Bursts]|h|r unless destroyed.\n\n$bullet; The initial Clotting Venom is protected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291530|h[Sanguineous Fortitude]|h|r."},
			{id=35048,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1283164|h[Imbibe]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players.\n\n$bullet; Vashnik's chamber fills with increasing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284561|h[Toxic Vapor]|h|r each time he |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1283164|h[Imbibes]|h|r.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299941|h[Siphoning Infection]|h|r absorbs a large amount of incoming healing."},
			{id=35049,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1280935|h[Dripping Fangs]|h|r inflicts increasing damage over time.\n\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284670|h[Imbibe]|h|r infuses Vashnik with the power of two nearby fountains."},
			{id=35941,title="Section 58",body="$[!16\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, Imbibe conjures Malignant Totem's from the venomous fountains. $]"},
