		sections={
			{id=35058,title="Overview",body="A mutated Zul'jan unleashes his new power by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282403|h[Coalescing Venom]|h|r within The Coiled Altar. He wields twin axes that |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299680|h[Sever]|h|r players and destroy Coalesced Venom.\n\nUpon Zul'jan's defeat, Malacrass joins the fray. Malacrass haunts players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285643|h[Dreadmarch]|h|r, creating Manifestations of Dread as it resolves. His casts of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286620|h[Soul Sever]|h|r hurt players and destroy any Manifestations of Dread in its blast.\n\nUpon defeat, Malacrass begins a ritual of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1304032|h[Soulbinding]|h|r to revive Zul'jan as his puppet, and claim what is rightfully his."},
			{id=35059,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299960|h[Toxic Deluge]|h|r creates |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282403|h[Coalesced Venom]|h|r around the arena.\n$bullet; Freeing players possessed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1297445|h[Dreadmarch]|h|r creates |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285844|h[Manifestations of Dread]|h|r that fixate on a random player.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286918|h[Eternal Nightfall]|h|r inflicts deadly damage unless |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286912|h[Veil of Twilight]|h|r is broken."},
			{id=35060,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282487|h[Fangs of the Coiled Altar]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1298381|h[Defilement of the Coiled Altar]|h|r inflicts massive damage and healing absorbs to all players.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282403|h[Coalesced Venom]|h|r explode into a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299838|h[Venom Rupture]|h|r when destroyed.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282287|h[Venomfang]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1310882|h[Gloombomb]|h|r inflict heavy damage."},
			{id=35061,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299680|h[Sever]|h|r inflicts a massive amount of damage, destroying |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1282403|h[Coalesced Venom]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286573|h[Soul Sever]|h|r afflicts players hit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286837|h[Gravebound]|h|r and destroys |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285844|h[Manifestations of Dread]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1298795|h[Corrupted Toxin]|h|r inflicts stacking moderate damage."},
