		sections={
			{id=35096,title="Overview",body="The Twin Fangs' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r accumulates throughout the battle. Vexhul funnels toxin into her target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289192|h[Caustic Deluge]|h|r forming |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289993|h[Caustic Globules]|h|r and calls her progeny with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291404|h[Venomous Emergence]|h|r. Ithraz consumes players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r and strikes repeatedly with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1288538|h[Stone Breaker]|h|r.\n\nAt 100 energy, both serpents submerge and reposition before attacking together. Vexhul releases a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1293749|h[Vile Flood]|h|r while Ithraz spews globs of gore during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1306872|h[Sanguine Storm]|h|r."},
			{id=35097,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289192|h[Caustic Deluge]|h|r ejects a salvo of globules which afflict players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r when touched.\n$[14,17$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r.$]\n$[15,16$bullet;High applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r kill players unless |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes those applications.$]\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291404|h[Venomous Emergence]|h|r summons Spawns of Vexhul which will continuously target players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291478|h[Corrosive Spit]|h|r."},
			{id=35098,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289192|h[Caustic Deluge]|h|r ejects a salvo of globules which afflict players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r when touched.\n$[14,17$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r.$]\n$[15,16$bullet;High applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r kill players unless |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes those applications.$]\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291404|h[Venomous Emergence]|h|r summons Spawns of Vexhul which will continuously target players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291478|h[Corrosive Spit]|h|r."},
			{id=35099,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289993|h[Caustic Globules]|h|r form near the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289192|h[Caustic Deluge]|h|r target.\n$[14,17$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r.$]\n$[15,16$bullet;High applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r kill players unless |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290516|h[Ravenous Feast]|h|r consumes those applications.$]\n$bullet;If |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1288538|h[Stone Breaker]|h|r strikes no players, it instead strikes all players."},
			{id=35638,title="Section 11",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=36855,title="Section 11",body="$[!15,16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, a player who dies while afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290336|h[Eternal Venom]|h|r spawns additional |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289993|h[Caustic Globules]|h|r.$]",difficultyIDs={16}},
