		sections={
			{id=35250,title="Overview",body="As Nek'zali energizes the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284032|h[Soulcoil Well]|h|r by invoking the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1288772|h[Soulcoil Rite]|h|r, she provokes the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289919|h[Restless Amani]|h|r to the well. \n\nUpon reaching 50% health, Nek'zali retreats to begin the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289683|h[Ritual of Awakening]|h|r. Destroying Echoes of Jawae removes their |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289696|h[Tethers of Awakening]|h|r and draws her back. \n\nUpon reaching full energy, she unwinds the Soulcoil and begins |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290003|h[Uncoiling]|h|r, empowering her with new abilities until her defeat."},
			{id=35251,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287426|h[Essence Rend]|h|r lingers and leaves behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287198|h[Latent Cultist]|h|r upon expiration.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289919|h[Restless Amani]|h|r awaken from the sarcophagi on the outer edges of the room, empowered with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287533|h[Gravebound Advance]|h|r until they are destroyed.\n$bullet;  Echoes of Jawae awaken during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292248|h[Soul Transfer]|h|r and provide Nek'zali with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289696|h[Tether of Awakening]|h|r."},
			{id=35252,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287426|h[Essence Rend]|h|r lingers and leaves behind a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287198|h[Latent Cultist]|h|r upon expiration.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1285681|h[Soulcoil Ignition]|h|r inflicts significant damage to all players.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1288772|h[Soulcoil Rite]|h|r inflicts deadly damage if too many souls enter the|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284032|h[Soulcoil Well]|h|r."},
			{id=35253,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292034|h[Possession Barrage]|h|r inflicts damage based on the distance each barrage travels.\n$bullet;  Echoes of Jawae awaken during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292248|h[Soul Transfer]|h|r and provide Nekk'zali with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289696|h[Tether of Awakening]|h|r.\n$bullet; Nek'zali attacks her target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1284109|h[Hollowing Strikes]|h|r."},
			{id=36184,title="Stage One: Soulcoiler Initiation"},
			{id=36049,title="Section 9"},
			{id=36048,title="Section 10",difficultyIDs={14,17,220}},
			{id=36540,title="Section 10",body="$[!15,16\n\nOn Heroic difficulty, the rite's power afflicts players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1297624|h[Ritual Burn]$]",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
