		sections={
			{id=35543,title="Overview",body="Mor'zahi uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1295451|h[Dark Whispers]|h|r to gain control over a group of tortollan explorers he has lured into the temple. If his control over them is broken, Mor'zahi casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1297024|h[Mor'zahi's Command]|h|r, expending all of his energy to reassert control and grant the target additional abilities.\n\nMor'zahi inflicts deadly damage if he is allowed to finish casting |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292779|h[Final Ascension]|h|r.\n\nMor'zahi's concentration can be broken if a tortollan he is controlling consumes a Disgusting Fish."},
			{id=35544,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Frost and Fire patches left behind by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1295886|h[Frostfire Volley]|h|r can be removed by the opposing elemental efects of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1295928|h[Burning Flames]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1295954|h[Piercing Frost]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1296092|h[Mighty Thud]|h|r inflicts very high damage to all players. Each impact inflicts damage split evenly between players directly hit.\n$bullet; Trader Gebbo's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1297625|h[Explosive Surprise]|h|r triggers |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1305844|h[Blas Wavet]|h|r, which can be avoided using the mushrooms from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292104|h[Mushroom Toss]|h|r."},
			{id=35545,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292793|h[Blink Nova]|h|r inflicts high damage to all players. Players farther from Scrollsage Iku's target receive less damage.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286921|h[Icebound Flames]|h|r inflicts high damage to a player if Scrollsage Iku is not interrupted, but the lingering effects can be dispelled.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1308853|h[Splinters]|h|r inflicts damage over time to any players who stomp on crates thrown by Trader Gebbo."},
			{id=35546,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1295854|h[Shredding Shards]|h|r from Scrollsage Iku inflicts high magic damage and vulnerability to this effect to the current target.\n$bullet; First Mate Nama's attacks against his current target gain increasing Physical damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1291930|h[Steady Strikes]|h|r.\n$bullet; First Mate Nama grants |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1297646|h[United Defense]|h|r to the tortollan explorers when Scrollsage Iku and Trader Gebbo are both near him."},
