		sections={
			{id=35548,title="Overview",body="Ula'tek splashes venom across her platform with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1292403|h[Caustic Waves]|h|r. Any Blightscale Spawn that touch her venom hatches and covers players in a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301268|h[Putrid Membrane]|h|r. While her slithering children continue to spawn, Ula'tek uses her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287265|h[Spectral Coils]|h|r to shatter the space.\n\nAfter Ula'tek rails against her prison with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286860|h[Rage of the Shackled]|h|r she summons her faithful then dives beneath the venom to gather her strength. Ula'tek's Doomscale Wardens move between the Blightscale Spawn imbuing them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290990|h[Writhing Gestation]|h|r as the Doomscale Eggs begin to hatch.\n\nWith her progeny broken, Ula'tek shatters the arena. She continues to use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300751|h[Call of the Serpent]|h|r to gather her forces while destroying the only safe spaces remaining with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301510|h[Circling Prey]|h|r."},
			{id=35549,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Blightscale Spawn hatch a Blightscale Viper when they connect with venom.\n$bullet; A |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1289962|h[Blightscale Clutch]|h|r grows in power unless destroyed.\n$bullet; Doomscale Wardens use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1290990|h[Writhing Gestation]|h|r on nearby Blightscale Spawn."},
			{id=35550,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Every Blightscale Viper hatched inflicts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301268|h[Putrid Membrane]|h|r to all players.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1287265|h[Spectral Coils]|h|r inflicts damage to everyone that is reduced by the number of players at the impact location."},
			{id=35551,title="Tank",body="$bullet; Ula'tek uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1286945|h[Unchecked Rage]|h|r while not engaged in melee combat.\n$bullet; Ula'tek's Gore Rattle uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1299206|h[Rattler Slam]|h|r while not engaged in melee combat. \n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1298367|h[Mother's Wrath]|h|r inflicts damage to everyone while no one is in its area of effect."},
			{id=36995,title="Blightscale Spawn",body="The endless spawn of Ula'tek. These eggs go through rapid gestation and hatch whenever they come into contact with the venom that fills Ula'tek's prison.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
